                <head>Convention between the United States and the United Kingdom for the avoidance
                    of double taxation on income</head>
                <p>[For text of the convention between the Governments of the United States and the
                    United Kingdom for the avoidance of double taxation and the prevention of fiscal
                    evasion with respect to taxes on income, signed at Washington April 16, 1945,
                    see Department of State, Treaties and Other International Acts Series No. 1546,
                    or 60 Stat, (pt, 2) 1377.]</p>
            </div>
